#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:21
msgid "10/100/1000 Mb/s Gigabit Ethernet with IEEE 802.3af PoE"
msgstr "IEEE 802.3af PoE ile 10/100/1000 Mb/s Gigabit Ethernet"

